      "updated": 1790830762618,
      "created": 1790752895313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Premise: \n\n* Very far into the future. (around 300-400 years in the future)\n\n* Machines took over and indoctrinated humans to follow their\n\"religion\"\n\n* Some of these machines attained \"enlightenment\" and called\nthemselves \"gods\"\n\n* player is an ancient non-AI robot who is only programmed to\nprotect humans\n\n* player upgrades himself after every boss kill\n\n* eventually becomes god himself (bad ending???)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Premise: \n\n* Very far into the future. (around 300-400 years in the future)\n\n* Machines took over and indoctrinated humans to follow their \"religion\"\n\n* Some of these machines attained \"enlightenment\" and called themselves \"gods\"\n\n* player is an ancient non-AI robot who is only programmed to protect humans\n\n* player upgrades himself after every boss kill\n\n* eventually becomes god himself (bad ending???)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
